  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "LNG\nThe LNG market softened this week, with shrinking cargo enquiry and a growing tonnage list putting pressure on freight rates. On the BLNG1 Australia-Japan route, rates eased by $800 week-on-week to settle at $73,500/day. The Pacific market remained relatively stable, as 2-stroke availability is currently tight.",
